     A            NASTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            NAUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            NAPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            NATIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            NADT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A            NAIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL' 'USER')
